00:50:48.631 --> 00:50:52.635
<i>♪ Just call me angel
Of the morning, angel ♪</i>


00:50:52.809 --> 00:50:58.337
<i>♪ Just touch my cheek
Before you leave me, baby ♪</i>


00:50:58.511 --> 00:51:03.820
<i>♪ Just call me angel
Of the morning, angel ♪</i>


00:51:07.346 --> 00:51:08.999
